{"hw":"πηρός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πηρός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πηρός</span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">παρός</span> implied in <span class=\"gk\">ἔμπαρος, παρόω</span>, qq.v.), <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ά</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">disabled in a limb, maimed</b>, <span class=\"gk\">αἱ δὲ χολωσάμεναι πηρὸν θέσαν</span> [the Muses] made him <b class=\"lex-tr\">helpless</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">blind</b> (cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aesop.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">57</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.599</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πηρὸς ὁ μὲν γυίοις, ὁ δ' ἄρ' ὄμμασι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.11</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phil.</span> </span> or <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isid.</span> </span>); <span class=\"gk\">πηραὶ τὰ σκέλεα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mul.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.131</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> of the mind, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Semon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.22</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀμβλεῖς καὶ π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.624</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. τῷ νῷ</span> Sch.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">48</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πηροὶ οἱ λογισμοί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Am.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">46</span> </span>.</div></div>"}